        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(control-ui): increase chat history limit from 100 to 500",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nIncrease `CHAT_HISTORY_REQUEST_LIMIT` from `100` to `500` in the Control UI WebChat.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe Control UI only loads 100 messages when opening a chat session. There is no scroll-to-top pagination to dynamically load older messages from the server (`chat.history` RPC supports `offset` pagination, but the frontend never uses it).\n\nThe virtual-scroll progressive render (`historyRenderLimit`) only reveals messages already fetched in the initial batch — it does not fetch more from the server.\n\n## Fix\n\nIncrease the hardcoded limit to 500 as a pragmatic fix. This covers most real-world sessions without requiring pagination UI changes.\n\nFixes #102139\n\n## Changes\n\n- `ui/src/pages/chat/chat-history.ts`: `CHAT_HISTORY_REQUEST_LIMIT` 100 → 500",
